    "name": "Life is Feudal: Arden",
    "steam_appid": 3285700,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a hand-crafted map offering distinct PvP and PvE zones, ensuring that there\u2019s something for everyone. In special PvPvE areas, you can hunt dangerous Knools for valuable resources. Stay alert at all times, as you may become the hunted if other players are after the same treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/9e9513cb63e85a058b0347e3b25bcd94.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/9e9513cb63e85a058b0347e3b25bcd94.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/9e9513cb63e85a058b0347e3b25bcd94.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enhanced crafting and construction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources to forge high-quality weapons and gear. With streamlined and clearer recipes, you can spend more time focusing on other essential aspects of the game. Build everything from modest shelters to prosperous villages and impregnable castles. The scale is limited only by your imagination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/19c3af9b85df755bc009a5465d69ba43.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/19c3af9b85df755bc009a5465d69ba43.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/19c3af9b85df755bc009a5465d69ba43.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic character progression</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gone are the days of needing multiple characters for different professions. In Arden, you can switch skills on your main character whenever you like. Visit a monument and become a blacksmith, farmer, or swap your tools for a sword to jump into battle. The choice is always yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/8f3d203415adb2db386d5989473889ae.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/8f3d203415adb2db386d5989473889ae.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/8f3d203415adb2db386d5989473889ae.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic trading system</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trading in Arden is as close to reality as it gets. With limited spots for trading posts, you\u2019ll need to choose your locations wisely. There\u2019s no instant delivery; you must personally transport goods for sale. And beware\u2014bandits lie in wait, ready to raid your caravan. Whether defending your goods or threatening others, stay vigilant on the trade routes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/bbd1adefeeb05019fece14c4fa4c3a06.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/bbd1adefeeb05019fece14c4fa4c3a06.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/bbd1adefeeb05019fece14c4fa4c3a06.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique combat &amp; epic battles\u00a0\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in Life is Feudal: Arden is both intuitive and realistic\u2014striking your enemy requires precision, and physical stats matter. Fight alongside allies in massive battles, participate in sieges, or hone your skills in the arena with PvP duels or group PvP skirmishes. The battlefield is your playground.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/5686a2f584ac0ec1fe902e24c6c8a18c.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/5686a2f584ac0ec1fe902e24c6c8a18c.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/5686a2f584ac0ec1fe902e24c6c8a18c.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Power struggles &amp; political intrigue</strong>\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a real political sandbox where alliances are made and broken. Participate in large-scale sieges and territory wars, conquer land on a real-world map, and tax those you defeat. In this world, might makes right\u2014winners write the history books.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/5eb73202e8831889abfb282ec95b2a46.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/5eb73202e8831889abfb282ec95b2a46.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/5eb73202e8831889abfb282ec95b2a46.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own medieval realm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a realistic medieval world with limitless possibilities, where your decisions shape not only your in-game experience but the game\u2019s development itself. Life is Feudal: Arden was made in close cooperation with players, with feedback driving important choices. Your voice plays a direct role in the future of the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/4f5868783706038040a8f12b2ffd87ba.poster.avif?t=1740492368\" width=616 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/4f5868783706038040a8f12b2ffd87ba.webm?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3285700/extras/4f5868783706038040a8f12b2ffd87ba.mp4?t=1740492368\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
